epos/godotengine/godot/issues/104404","id":2741601033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jaYMJ","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-20T20:34:42Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T20:34:42Z","body":"My thoughts are the same as on [the PR that precedes this one](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99783#issuecomment-2507738053):\r\n\r\n> _I'm in no position to say this with absolute certainty_, but if this PR actually goes through, but we may avoid the single argument constructor in the codebase. Code readability is a huge factor, both for GDScript and internally. Whether this common convention should be implemented in GDScript is still contested, even if not really to the point of outright loathing the feature, as many users from different backgrounds desire this.\r\n\r\nThat's not to discourage progress on this PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741601033/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimi